2026-09-23  Jörgen Johansson

	* explicit_bzero.c: Clarified the documentation explaining why
	explicit_bzero() must remain an out-of-line function.

	* bcopy.c: Corrected the revision history by adding the missing
	revision 1.1 entry for the CPU-specific implementations and
	renumbering the later count-guard update from 1.1.1.2 to 1.2.

	* library/lseekw.c, library/start.S, include/unistd.h: Completed the
	removal of the obsolete lseekw() compatibility wrapper by removing
	its implementation, library vector and public declaration.

	* BUGS: Removed the AF_UNIX datagram, connection-timeout and
	socket-option entries. These describe planned implementation work
	already covered by TODO, rather than bugs without an obvious
	solution.

2026-09-21  Jörgen Johansson

	* (library/unvis.c): reject incomplete escape sequences at end of input
	in strunvis() and strnunvis() instead of silently accepting them.
	
	* select.c: Corrected the revision history by removing the incorrect
	statement that revision 1.15 introduced a 68000/68010 inline-assembly
	scanner.

2026-09-13  Jörgen Johansson

    ixemul.library development for version 80.

	Major work includes new libc/POSIX/BSD interfaces, AF_UNIX stream
	sockets, poll(), clock interfaces, allocator improvements, extensive
	TTY/PTY work, descriptor and close lifetime fixes, select() rework,
	string/memory optimizations, stdio correctness fixes, filesystem and
	pathname fixes, socket hardening and numerous m68k-specific
	correctness and performance improvements.

	Detailed changes, dates and implementation notes are recorded in the
	revision comments of the individual source files.

